# BLOONZ PROJECT SCOPE

Emulate BTD1

The game has a map that has a path on it, ~5 towers that can be placed on the map, balloons that follow a path on the map.
The game is round based; balloons come down the path each round. 
Towers have different abilities in order to pop the balloons, ie basic shoot, splash damage, slow-down etc. 
Get money for popping balloons, use money to buy and upgrade towers.

If the balloons get to the end of the path you take damage, lose all your health you die.

Last as long as you can/reach a high score

Hook high scores up to a cloud DB to be stored.
